'''Polished blackstone''' is the [[stone]]-like polished variation of [[blackstone]].

== Obtaining ==
=== Breaking ===
Polished blackstone needs to be broken using a pickaxe, otherwise the block drops nothing.
{{Breaking row
|horizontal=1
|Polished Blackstone
|link=none
|Pickaxe
|Wood
}}

Polished blackstone has a slightly higher hardness (thus takes slightly longer to break) than its chiseled variant.<ref>{{bug|MC-177880|||WAI}}</ref>

=== Natural generation ===
Polished blackstone can generate as part of [[ruined portal]]s in [[the Nether]].

=== Crafting ===
{{Crafting
|A2 = Blackstone
|B2 = Blackstone
|A3 = Blackstone
|B3 = Blackstone
|Output = Polished Blackstone,4
|type = Building block
}}

